<LegalLayout title="Support" description="HonorCart support, privacy, and attribution-reporting contacts."><h2>Extension help</h2><p>For installation problems, coupon issues, unexpected merchant behavior, or questions about the extension’s disclosure, email <a href="mailto:support@honorcart.com">support@honorcart.com</a>. Include your browser version, the merchant hostname, and a description of what happened. Do not send payment details, passwords, full checkout URLs, or screenshots containing sensitive information.</p><h2>Attribution concerns</h2><p>Creators, publishers, merchants, and affiliate networks can report a possible attribution conflict to <a href="mailto:attribution@honorcart.com">attribution@honorcart.com</a>. HonorCart will acknowledge credible reports promptly, disable affected monetization while necessary, and investigate against the public <a href="/transparency">stand-down policy</a>.</p><h2>Privacy requests</h2><p>Questions or requests concerning information you submitted directly can be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@honorcart.com">privacy@honorcart.com</a>. You can withdraw extension consent and clear local extension data from its Privacy &amp; controls page.</p><h2>Merchant and network requests</h2><p>Merchant program changes, traffic restrictions, and kill-switch requests can be sent to <a href="mailto:compliance@honorcart.com">compliance@honorcart.com</a>. HonorCart defaults to disabling monetization while an approval or policy question is unresolved.</p><h2>Service status</h2><p>HonorCart is in private beta. There are currently no approved monetized merchants and no live extension telemetry. Material policy and product changes are published in <a href="/updates">Updates</a>.</p></LegalLayout>
